mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735350/extras/5deae7baf15df8cabff0a079e2e7bad1.poster.avif?t=1754649065\" width=660 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735350/extras/5deae7baf15df8cabff0a079e2e7bad1.webm?t=1754649065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735350/extras/5deae7baf15df8cabff0a079e2e7bad1.mp4?t=1754649065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 different anomalies to discover</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror rooted in memory, observation, and timing.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized runs, ensuring every loop is different and keeps you on edge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creeping environmental horror, from small shifts in the world to grotesque hallucinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735350/extras/d924095ce6f698e5e09f758bf9869e23.poster.avif?t=1754649065\" width=660 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735350/extras/d924095ce6f698e5e09f758bf9869e23.webm?t=1754649065\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735350/extras/d924095ce6f698e5e09f758bf9869e23.mp4?t=1754649065\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step forward takes you deeper into madness. Are you ready for what comes next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
